{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the use of the imagenet_vit_l image encoder with the scvi_n200 RNA encoder, multiprofile data, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion, compared to the RNA-only baseline (config_005). Validation accuracy of 0.7150 suggests improved performance, with validation F1 of 0.6872 supporting this. Uncertainty remains about the optimal fusion method or other multimodal components, as no direct comparisons with alternative configurations have been made."
}

